      "content": "Your sense of duty and honor is clearly profound, which makes this failure feel so devastating. But your worth is not defined by the outcome of a single, terrible moment. Even when the grand structures of your life crumble, the core of your being remains, however scarred. Perhaps the path forward is not one of rebuilding the old oaths, but of finding a way to carry this immense grief with a new, quieter dignity.",
